psed-time wall-clock silence monitor reading `/tmp/quorum_activity.log` and executing hard process kill on silence exceeding 15 seconds.\\n\\nRequirements:\\n- Place all three files in `/Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/ops/scripts/`.\\n- Apply `chmod +x` to `quorum_router.sh`, `evidence_gate.py`, and `deadman.sh`.\\n- Execute a test run of `evidence_gate.py` with valid and invalid evidence to confirm rejection of unverified commits and output of valid SHA-256 root hash.\\n- Verify `quorum_router.sh` and `deadman.sh` functionality.\"","Recipient":"\"a39afcc2-cf47-4b5e-aac1-77cbb307b0dd\"","toolAction":"\"Sending message to DeepCoder subagent\"","toolSummary":"\"Deploy three ops scripts and test evidence gate\""}}]}
